# --- Door.events (locked-door puzzle) ---
# Hover shows the hint. Clicking checks whether the player holds the Key.
# `HasKey` is a global story flag the key pickup sets (the door's sheet cannot
# read Player's bag directly — see DESIGN.md §9 note on possessive bag checks).

when me is hovered
  show text "A locked door."

when me is clicked
  unless HasKey is true
  play sound "locked.wav"
  show text "It's locked."

when me is clicked
  HasKey is true
  play sound "unlock.wav"
  set my Locked to false
  show text "The door creaks open."
